{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012W3busPYhJ26anuHkV4PjL","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tsource_url: \"https://github.com/cncf/curriculum/commits/master/KCNA_Curriculum.pdf\"\n3\tfetched_at: \"2026-08-23T23:50:00-0400\"\n4\tauthority: \"Cloud Native Computing Foundation — cncf/curriculum repository, version control history\"\n5\tobjectives_covered: []\n6\tconcepts_covered: [\"blueprint-change-2025-11-24\"]\n7\t---\n8\t\n9\t# CNCF curriculum repository — KCNA curriculum version history\n10\t\n11\tPrimary-source provenance for the KCNA blueprint change. The cncf/curriculum\n12\trepo is CNCF's official publication channel for exam curricula; its README\n13\tstates \"Old versions remain available.\"\n14\t\n15\t## Commit history for KCNA_Curriculum.pdf\n16\t\n17\t- 06702fe — \"KCNA Exam Curriculum\" — zuzannapn — Nov 24, 2025\n18\t- 308c903 — \"Archiving exam curriculum\" — zuzannapn — Nov 24, 2025\n19\t- 4461347 — \"KCNA Exam Curriculum\" — caitmulholland — Nov 19, 2021\n20\t- a25cd84 — \"archive old KCNA\" — caitmulholland — Nov 19, 2021\n21\t- f7c6c89 — \"KCNA Curriculum - Coming Q4 2021\" — caitmulholland — Oct 11, 2021\n22\t\n23\tThe two 2025-11-24 commits are the blueprint change. This independently confirms\n24\tthe effective date given on the LF program-changes page (\"no earlier than\n25\tNovember 24, 2025\").\n26\t\n27\t## Where the retired five-domain curriculum lives\n28\t\n29\tCommit 308c903 moved the pre-change PDF to:\n30\t\n31\t    old-versions/KCNA_Curriculum old.pdf     (152 KB)\n32\t\n33\tRaw URL:\n34\thttps://github.com/cncf/curriculum/raw/master/old-versions/KCNA_Curriculum%20old.pdf\n35\t\n36\t## OPEN GAP — text not extracted\n37\t\n38\tThe retired domain weights are NOT recorded in this snapshot because the\n39\tresearch stage could not extract the PDF's text (binary not readable by the\n40\tavailable tools; sandbox blocked local download; GitHub's blob viewer errored).\n41\t\n42\tDO NOT draft the retired weights from memory or from third-party study guides.\n43\tRetrieve the PDF above and record its domain list in\n44\tcncf-kcna-curriculum-retired-2026-08-23.md first.\n45\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"49650605-8009-40d5-9276-2f4d91700b57","uuid":"1238e92b-6d4d-4e43-bd0f-d7d63a0a64ca","timestamp":"2026-08-24T15:35:38.974Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\dev\\lodestar\\Book-KCNA\\sources\\cncf-curriculum-repo-kcna-versions-2026-08-23.md","content":"---\nsource_url: \"https://github.com/cncf/curriculum/commits/master/KCNA_Curriculum.pdf\"\nfetched_at: \"2026-08-23T23:50:00-0400\"\nauthority: \"Cloud Native Computing Foundation — cncf/curriculum repository, version control history\"\nobjectives_covered: []\nconcepts_covered: [\"blueprint-change-2025-11-24\"]\n---\n\n# CNCF curriculum repository — KCNA curriculum version history\n\nPrimary-source provenance for the KCNA blueprint change. The cncf/curriculum\nrepo is CNCF's official publication channel for exam curricula; its README\nstates \"Old versions remain available.\"\n\n## Commit history for KCNA_Curriculum.pdf\n\n- 06702fe — \"KCNA Exam Curriculum\" — zuzannapn — Nov 24, 2025\n- 308c903 — \"Archiving exam curriculum\" — zuzannapn — Nov 24, 2025\n- 4461347 — \"KCNA Exam Curriculum\" — caitmulholland — Nov 19, 2021\n- a25cd84 — \"archive old KCNA\" — caitmulholland — Nov 19, 2021\n- f7c6c89 — \"KCNA Curriculum - Coming Q4 2021\" — caitmulholland — Oct 11, 2021\n\nThe two 2025-11-24 commits are the blueprint change. This independently confirms\nthe effective date given on the LF program-changes page (\"no earlier than\nNovember 24, 2025\").\n\n## Where the retired five-domain curriculum lives\n\nCommit 308c903 moved the pre-change PDF to:\n\n    old-versions/KCNA_Curriculum old.pdf     (152 KB)\n\nRaw URL:\nhttps://github.com/cncf/curriculum/raw/master/old-versions/KCNA_Curriculum%20old.pdf\n\n## OPEN GAP — text not extracted\n\nThe retired domain weights are NOT recorded in this snapshot because the\nresearch stage could not extract the PDF's text (binary not readable by the\navailable tools; sandbox blocked local download; GitHub's blob viewer errored).\n\nDO NOT draft the retired weights from memory or from third-party study guides.\nRetrieve the PDF above and record its domain list in\ncncf-kcna-curriculum-retired-2026-08-23.md first.\n","numLines":45,"startLine":1,"totalLines":45}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TLq4FVXKASN71ko1x6zWoQ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tsource_url: \"https://training.linuxfoundation.org/certification/kubernetes-cloud-native-associate/\"\n3\tfetched_at: \"2026-08-23T23:50:00-0400\"\n4\tauthority: \"The Linux Foundation (Training & Certification) — official exam product page\"\n5\tobjectives_covered: []\n6\tconcepts_covered: [\"kcna-exam-format\", \"domain-weights-44-28-16-12\", \"published-vs-commonly-reported\", \"cncf-certification-ladder\"]\n7\t---\n8\t\n9\t# Kubernetes and Cloud Native Associate (KCNA) — Linux Foundation official exam page\n10\t\n11\t> Re-fetched and expanded 2026-08-23T23:50 for Chapter 1. Supersedes the thinner\n12\t> capture taken at 22:30 the same day. All quoted strings are verbatim.\n13\t\n14\t## What the exam demonstrates\n15\t\n16\t\"The Kubernetes and Cloud Native Associate (KCNA) exam demonstrates a user's foundational knowledge and skills in Kubernetes and the wider cloud native ecosystem.\"\n17\t\n18\t## Experience level and prerequisites\n19\t\n20\tExperience Level: \"Beginner\"\n21\tPrerequisites: \"There are no prerequisites for this exam.\"\n22\t\n23\t## Exam details\n24\t\n25\tFormat: \"This exam is an online, proctored, multiple-choice exam.\"\n26\tDuration: \"90 minutes\"\n27\t\n28\tPricing tiers:\n29\t- \"Certification exam only – $250\"\n30\t- \"Certification exam + THRIVE-ONE Annual Subscription... – $495\"\n31\t- \"Certification exam + Kubernetes and Cloud Native Essentials (LFS250) course – $299\"\n32\t\n33\tEligibility and attempts:\n34\t- \"12-months to schedule & take the exam\"\n35\t- \"Two exam attempts\"\n36\t\n37\tValidity: \"Certification Valid for 2 Years\"\n38\t\n39\t## Domains and competencies\n40\t\n41\t- \"Kubernetes Fundamentals 44%\" — Kubernetes Core Concepts; Administration; Scheduling; Containerization\n42\t- \"Container Orchestration 28%\" — Networking; Security; Troubleshooting; Storage\n43\t- \"Cloud Native Application Delivery 16%\" — Application Delivery; Debugging\n44\t- \"Cloud Native Architecture 12%\" — Observability; Cloud Native Ecosystem and Principles; Cloud Native Community and Collaboration\n45\t\n46\t## What this page does NOT state\n47\t\n48\tConfirmed by targeted re-fetch on 2026-08-23:\n49\t- No question count stated.\n50\t- No passing score stated.\n51\t\n52\tWARNING — do not generalize this. This snapshot supports only the narrow claim\n53\tthat the exam product page omits both figures. The passing score IS published by\n54\tthe Linux Foundation elsewhere: see lf-mc-exam-faq-2026-08-23.md (75%). The\n55\tquestion count remains unlocated in any authoritative LF or CNCF source.\n56\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"49650605-8009-40d5-9276-2f4d91700b57","uuid":"b3960f28-bc01-446c-90b8-98184d81bced","timestamp":"2026-08-24T15:35:38.976Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\dev\\lodestar\\Book-KCNA\\sources\\lf-kcna-exam-page-2026-08-23.md","content":"---\nsource_url: \"https://training.linuxfoundation.org/certification/kubernetes-cloud-native-associate/\"\nfetched_at: \"2026-08-23T23:50:00-0400\"\nauthority: \"The Linux Foundation (Training & Certification) — official exam product page\"\nobjectives_covered: []\nconcepts_covered: [\"kcna-exam-format\", \"domain-weights-44-28-16-12\", \"published-vs-commonly-reported\", \"cncf-certification-ladder\"]\n---\n\n# Kubernetes and Cloud Native Associate (KCNA) — Linux Foundation official exam page\n\n> Re-fetched and expanded 2026-08-23T23:50 for Chapter 1. Supersedes the thinner\n> capture taken at 22:30 the same day. All quoted strings are verbatim.\n\n## What the exam demonstrates\n\n\"The Kubernetes and Cloud Native Associate (KCNA) exam demonstrates a user's foundational knowledge and skills in Kubernetes and the wider cloud native ecosystem.\"\n\n## Experience level and prerequisites\n\nExperience Level: \"Beginner\"\nPrerequisites: \"There are no prerequisites for this exam.\"\n\n## Exam details\n\nFormat: \"This exam is an online, proctored, multiple-choice exam.\"\nDuration: \"90 minutes\"\n\nPricing tiers:\n- \"Certification exam only – $250\"\n- \"Certification exam + THRIVE-ONE Annual Subscription... – $495\"\n- \"Certification exam + Kubernetes and Cloud Native Essentials (LFS250) course – $299\"\n\nEligibility and attempts:\n- \"12-months to schedule & take the exam\"\n- \"Two exam attempts\"\n\nValidity: \"Certification Valid for 2 Years\"\n\n## Domains and competencies\n\n- \"Kubernetes Fundamentals 44%\" — Kubernetes Core Concepts; Administration; Scheduling; Containerization\n- \"Container Orchestration 28%\" — Networking; Security; Troubleshooting; Storage\n- \"Cloud Native Application Delivery 16%\" — Application Delivery; Debugging\n- \"Cloud Native Architecture 12%\" — Observability; Cloud Native Ecosystem and Principles; Cloud Native Community and Collaboration\n\n## What this page does NOT state\n\nConfirmed by targeted re-fetch on 2026-08-23:\n- No question count stated.\n- No passing score stated.\n\nWARNING — do not generalize this. This snapshot supports only the narrow claim\nthat the exam product page omits both figures. The passing score IS published by\nthe Linux Foundation elsewhere: see lf-mc-exam-faq-2026-08-23.md (75%). The\nquestion count remains unlocated in any authoritative LF or CNCF source.\n","numLines":56,"startLine":1,"totalLines":56}}}
